{"visibility": "domain", "fields": [{"name": "datahora", "description": null, "annotations": {"facetsort": "-count", "facet": true, "timerangeFilter": true, "timeserie_precision": "minute"}, "label": "Date/Time", "type": "datetime", "label_en": "Date/Time", "label_pt": "Data/Hora", "description_en": null, "description_pt": null}, {"name": "dia", "description": null, "annotations": {"facetsort": "-count", "facet": true}, "label": "Day", "type": "text", "label_en": "Day", "label_pt": "Dia", "description_en": null, "description_pt": null}, {"name": "mes", "description": null, "annotations": {"facetsort": "-count", "facet": true}, "label": "Month", "type": "text", "label_en": "Month", "label_pt": "M\u00eas", "description_en": null, "description_pt": null}, {"name": "ano", "description": null, "annotations": {"facetsort": "alphanum", "facet": true}, "label": "Year", "type": "text", "label_en": "Year", "label_pt": "Ano", "description_en": null, "description_pt": null}, {"name": "date", "description": null, "annotations": {"facetsort": "-count", "facet": true, "timeserie_precision": "day"}, "label": "Date", "type": "date", "label_en": "Date", "label_pt": "Data", "description_en": null, "description_pt": null}, {"name": "time", "description": null, "annotations": {"facetsort": "-count", "facet": true}, "label": "Hour", "type": "text", "label_en": "Hour", "label_pt": "Hora", "description_en": null, "description_pt": null}, {"name": "dgm", "description": "DGM", "annotations": {}, "label": "Market (kWh)", "type": "double", "label_en": "Market (kWh)", "label_pt": "Mercado (kWh)", "description_en": "DGM", "description_pt": "DGM"}, {"name": "pre", "description": "PRE", "annotations": {}, "label": "Special Regime (kWh)", "type": "double", "label_en": "Special Regime (kWh)", "label_pt": "Regime Especial (kWh)", "description_en": "PRE", "description_pt": "PRE"}, {"name": "total", "description": null, "annotations": {"facetsort": "-count"}, "label": "Total (kWh)", "type": "double", "label_en": "Total (kWh)", "label_pt": "Total (kWh)", "description_en": null, "description_pt": null}], "dataset_id": "energia-produzida-total-nacional", "dataset_uid": "da_cwao9t", "has_records": true, "features": ["analyze", "timeserie"], "attachments": [], "alternative_exports": [], "data_visible": true, "metas": {"default": {"title": "Total National Produced Energy", "title_en": "Total National Produced Energy", "title_pt": "Energia Produzida Total Nacional", "description": "<p>This Dataset represents the total energy produced nationally.</p><p>It is composed of the following elements:</p><ul><li>DGM (Market Generation Diagram) referring to the energy production of producers that are on the market - Information provided by REN;<br>\n</li><li>PRE (Special Regime Production) referring to the energy production of producers under special regime;<br>\n</li><li>Sum of DGM and PRE production (Total).</li></ul><p>The data is obtained through total production on the market and producers under special regime. At the end of each 15-minute period, the meter stores the total amount of energy during that interval.</p><p>The update frequency is daily.</p><p><b>Use case:</b> This data allows us to monitor the evolution of energy produced at a national level.</p><p>\u00a0</p><p>1. The information made available by E-REDES constitutes an approximation to the values taken from the system and is based on the moment in which it is collected. Given that the connection points, the electricity distribution network, and the consumption and production values themselves are naturally very dynamic, it is safeguarded that the information made available may be subject to subsequent changes and updates, with the exception of any omissions and/or occasional inaccuracies of location that the information may contain.</p><p>2. In this way, E-REDES is not liable to third parties, namely, partners, service providers, contractors, users and customers, for damages that may arise as a result, direct or indirect, of the use of this Information, in particular when carrying out interventions, calculations and/or estimates, without confirming the accuracy and updating of the data, whereby it is duly noted that the consultation of this information does not affect the duty to promote a direct consultation with E-REDES in order to obtain updated information.</p><p>\u00a0</p><p>The data provided by the E-REDES Open Data Portal is covered by open licenses (CC BY 4.0). There are no restrictions on access, under the commitment that data users cite the publisher. Therefore, we suggest that you cite the Open Data E-REDES Portal as:</p><p>E-REDES \u2013 Distribui\u00e7\u00e3o de Eletricidade, \u201cE-REDES Open Data Portal\u201d. Accessed in \u201cData\u201d. [Online] Available at <a aria-label=\"Liga\u00e7\u00e3o https://e-redes.opendatasoft.com/pages/homepage/\" class=\"fui-Link ___1q1shib f2hkw1w f3rmtva f1ewtqcl fyind8e f1k6fduh f1w7gpdv fk6fouc fjoy568 figsok6 f1s184ao f1mk8lai fnbmjn9 f1o700av f13mvf36 f1cmlufx f9n3di6 f1ids18y f1tx3yz7 f1deo86v f1eh06m1 f1iescvh fhgqx19 f1olyrje f1p93eir f1nev41a f1h8hb77 f1lqvz6u f10aw75t fsle3fq f17ae5zn\" href=\"https://e-redes.opendatasoft.com/pages/homepage/\" id=\"menur1hrr\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"https://e-redes.opendatasoft.com/pages/homepage/\">https://e-redes.opendatasoft.com/pages/homepage/</a></p><p><span data-teams=\"true\"></span></p><p>If you share on social media, please add #PortalOpenData_E_REDES</p>", "description_en": "<p>This Dataset represents the total energy produced nationally.</p><p>It is composed of the following elements:</p><ul><li>DGM (Market Generation Diagram) referring to the energy production of producers that are on the market - Information provided by REN;<br>\n</li><li>PRE (Special Regime Production) referring to the energy production of producers under special regime;<br>\n</li><li>Sum of DGM and PRE production (Total).</li></ul><p>The data is obtained through total production on the market and producers under special regime. At the end of each 15-minute period, the meter stores the total amount of energy during that interval.</p><p>The update frequency is daily.</p><p><b>Use case:</b> This data allows us to monitor the evolution of energy produced at a national level.</p><p>\u00a0</p><p>1. The information made available by E-REDES constitutes an approximation to the values taken from the system and is based on the moment in which it is collected. Given that the connection points, the electricity distribution network, and the consumption and production values themselves are naturally very dynamic, it is safeguarded that the information made available may be subject to subsequent changes and updates, with the exception of any omissions and/or occasional inaccuracies of location that the information may contain.</p><p>2. In this way, E-REDES is not liable to third parties, namely, partners, service providers, contractors, users and customers, for damages that may arise as a result, direct or indirect, of the use of this Information, in particular when carrying out interventions, calculations and/or estimates, without confirming the accuracy and updating of the data, whereby it is duly noted that the consultation of this information does not affect the duty to promote a direct consultation with E-REDES in order to obtain updated information.</p><p>\u00a0</p><p>The data provided by the E-REDES Open Data Portal is covered by open licenses (CC BY 4.0). There are no restrictions on access, under the commitment that data users cite the publisher. Therefore, we suggest that you cite the Open Data E-REDES Portal as:</p><p>E-REDES \u2013 Distribui\u00e7\u00e3o de Eletricidade, \u201cE-REDES Open Data Portal\u201d. Accessed in \u201cData\u201d. [Online] Available at <a aria-label=\"Liga\u00e7\u00e3o https://e-redes.opendatasoft.com/pages/homepage/\" class=\"fui-Link ___1q1shib f2hkw1w f3rmtva f1ewtqcl fyind8e f1k6fduh f1w7gpdv fk6fouc fjoy568 figsok6 f1s184ao f1mk8lai fnbmjn9 f1o700av f13mvf36 f1cmlufx f9n3di6 f1ids18y f1tx3yz7 f1deo86v f1eh06m1 f1iescvh fhgqx19 f1olyrje f1p93eir f1nev41a f1h8hb77 f1lqvz6u f10aw75t fsle3fq f17ae5zn\" href=\"https://e-redes.opendatasoft.com/pages/homepage/\" id=\"menur1hrr\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"https://e-redes.opendatasoft.com/pages/homepage/\">https://e-redes.opendatasoft.com/pages/homepage/</a></p><p><span data-teams=\"true\"></span></p><p>If you share on social media, please add #PortalOpenData_E_REDES</p>", "description_pt": "<p>Este Dataset representa o total de energia produzida a n\u00edvel nacional.</p><p>\u00c9 composto pelos seguintes elementos: </p><ul><li>DGM (Diagrama de Gera\u00e7\u00e3o de Mercado) referente \u00e0 produ\u00e7\u00e3o de energia dos produtores que est\u00e3o em mercado - Informa\u00e7\u00e3o disponibilizada pela REN;</li><li>PRE (Produ\u00e7\u00e3o em Regime Especial) referente \u00e0 produ\u00e7\u00e3o de energia dos produtores em regime especial;</li><li>Soma da produ\u00e7\u00e3o DGM e PRE (Total).</li></ul><p>Os dados s\u00e3o obtidos atrav\u00e9s do total de produ\u00e7\u00e3o em mercado e dos produtores em regime especial.\u00a0<span style=\"font-size: 0.875rem;\">No final de cada per\u00edodo de 15 minutos, o medidor armazena o valor total de energia durante esse intervalo.</span></p><p></p><p>A periodicidade de atualiza\u00e7\u00e3o \u00e9 di\u00e1ria.</p><p><b>Use case</b>: Estes dados permitem fazer o acompanhamento da evolu\u00e7\u00e3o da energia produzida a n\u00edvel Nacional.</p><p><br></p><p>1. A Informa\u00e7\u00e3o disponibilizada pela E-REDES constitui uma aproxima\u00e7\u00e3o aos valores retirados de sistema e tem por refer\u00eancia o momento em que a mesma \u00e9 recolhida. Atendendo a que os pontos de liga\u00e7\u00e3o, a rede de distribui\u00e7\u00e3o de eletricidade, e os pr\u00f3prios valores de consumo e de produ\u00e7\u00e3o s\u00e3o naturalmente muito din\u00e2micos, salvaguarda-se que a informa\u00e7\u00e3o disponibilizada poder\u00e1 ser objeto de subsequentes altera\u00e7\u00f5es e atualiza\u00e7\u00f5es, ficando igualmente ressalvadas eventuais omiss\u00f5es e/ou pontuais imprecis\u00f5es de localiza\u00e7\u00e3o que a informa\u00e7\u00e3o poder\u00e1 conter.<br></p><p></p><p>2. Desta forma a E-REDES n\u00e3o se responsabiliza perante terceiros, nomeadamente, parceiros, prestadores de servi\u00e7os, empreiteiros, utentes e clientes, pelos danos que possam surgir em consequ\u00eancia, direta ou indireta, do uso da presente Informa\u00e7\u00e3o, em particular aquando da realiza\u00e7\u00e3o de interven\u00e7\u00f5es, c\u00e1lculos e/ou estimativas, sem confirma\u00e7\u00e3o da exatid\u00e3o e atualiza\u00e7\u00e3o dos dados, pelo que devidamente se ressalva de que a consulta da presente informa\u00e7\u00e3o n\u00e3o prejudica o dever de se promover uma consulta direta \u00e0 E-REDES para obter informa\u00e7\u00e3o atualizada.</p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"font-size: inherit;\">Os dados fornecidos pelo Portal Open Data da E-REDES s\u00e3o abrangidos por licen\u00e7as abertas (</span><a aria-label=\"Link CC BY 4.0\" class=\"fui-Link ___1rxvrpe f2hkw1w f3rmtva f1ewtqcl fyind8e f1k6fduh f1w7gpdv fk6fouc fjoy568 figsok6 f1hu3pq6 f11qmguv f19f4twv f1tyq0we f1g0x7ka fhxju0i f1qch9an f1cnd47f fqv5qza f1vmzxwi f1o700av f13mvf36 f1cmlufx f9n3di6 f1ids18y f1tx3yz7 f1deo86v f1eh06m1 f1iescvh fhgqx19 f1olyrje f1p93eir f1nev41a f1h8hb77 f1lqvz6u f10aw75t fsle3fq f17ae5zn\" href=\"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/\">CC BY 4.0</a><span style=\"font-size: inherit;\">). N\u00e3o existem restri\u00e7\u00f5es ao seu acesso, sob o compromisso de os utilizadores dos dados citarem o publicador. Assim, sugerimos que cite o Portal Open Data E-REDES como:</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: inherit;\">E-REDES \u2013 Distribui\u00e7\u00e3o de eletricidade, \u201cPortal Open Data E-REDES\u201d. Acedido em \u201cData\u201d. [Online] Dispon\u00edvel em </span><a aria-label=\"Link https://e-redes.opendatasoft.com/pages/homepage/\" class=\"fui-Link ___1rxvrpe f2hkw1w f3rmtva f1ewtqcl fyind8e f1k6fduh f1w7gpdv fk6fouc fjoy568 figsok6 f1hu3pq6 f11qmguv f19f4twv f1tyq0we f1g0x7ka fhxju0i f1qch9an f1cnd47f fqv5qza f1vmzxwi f1o700av f13mvf36 f1cmlufx f9n3di6 f1ids18y f1tx3yz7 f1deo86v f1eh06m1 f1iescvh fhgqx19 f1olyrje f1p93eir f1nev41a f1h8hb77 f1lqvz6u f10aw75t fsle3fq f17ae5zn\" href=\"https://e-redes.opendatasoft.com/pages/homepage/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"https://e-redes.opendatasoft.com/pages/homepage/\"><span style=\"font-size: inherit;\">https://e-redes.opendatasoft.com/pages/homepage/</span></a></p><p><span class=\"ui-provider a b c d e f g h i j k l m n o p q r s t u v w x y z ab ac ae af ag ah ai aj ak\" dir=\"ltr\"></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: inherit;\">Se partilhar nas redes sociais, por favor acrescente #PortalOpenData_E_REDES</span></p>", "theme": ["Consumption and Energy", "Renewables"], "theme_en": ["Consumption and Energy", "Renewables"], "theme_pt": ["Consumos e Energia", "Renov\u00e1veis"], "keyword": null, "keyword_en": null, "keyword_pt": null, "license": "CC BY 4.0", "license_en": "CC BY 4.0", "license_pt": "CC BY 4.0", "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/", "license_url_en": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/", "license_url_pt": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/", "language": "pt", "modified": "2026-11-12T14:35:19+00:00", "publisher": "E-REDES", "publisher_en": "E-REDES", "publisher_pt": "E-REDES", "references": null, "attributions": null, "update_frequency": null, "bbox": null, "data_processed": "2026-11-12T14:35:19+00:00", "federated": false, "geographic_reference": ["world_pt"], "geographic_reference_auto": false, "geometry_types": null, "metadata_languages": ["pt", "en"], "metadata_processed": "2026-11-